      "id": 110966,
      "name": "Season 16",
      "overview": "The Croatian sun has set but the drama is rising. Things are hotting-up in SW3, as the MIC boys and girls reunite on their home turf for an unforgettable series. Expect scandalous secrets, rocky romances, frosty friendships and…an engagement (or three). The series bursts onto screens on Monday 8th October @ 9pm on E4. Can old relationships be resuscitated? Will broken friendships be repaired? Are seemingly solid couples strong enough to weather the Chelsea storm? This series charts the highs and lows of the cast as they quaff champagne in the Royal Borough’s most sought after hot spots. Returning this series will be a favourites, Jamie Laing, Ollie Locke, Louise Thompson and her fiancé Ryan Libbey, Mark Francis, Victoria Baker Harber, Sam Thompson, Olivia Bentley, Oliver Proudlock, Sophie Herman, Alex Mytton, Harry Baron, Melissa Tattam, , Digby Edgley, Sophie Habboo (Habbs), Miles Nazaire, James Taylor, and Emily Blackwell. Ollie's fiancé, Gareth Locke, will also make an appearance.",
